<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL unit mark notes due 2001.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL unit mark notes due 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Friday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA to the DSL Finance NV's 250 million mark 4.50 percent notes due 2001.</p>
<p>The issue is guaranteed by Deutsche Siedlungs- und Landesrentenbank (DSL Bank).</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>For an explanation of ratings categories double click on AAA/ or type in AAA/ then press F9</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
